# LaTeX out-of-tree build artifacts (slides build into <slides>/build/)
**/build/
*.aux
*.log
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.nav
*.snm
*.toc
*.out
*.bbl
*.blg

# Per-paper scratch space (extracted text, intermediate notes) — not committed.
# Final deliverables (summary.md, translation.md, slides/*.tex) ARE committed.
papers/*/_workspace/

# icml_2026: 원본 촬영 사진(145MB)과 arXiv 논문 PDF(41MB)는 커밋하지 않음.
# 리포트는 report/assets/(EXIF 보정·다운샘플 사본)만으로 재빌드 가능하고,
# 논문 PDF는 icml_2026/papers/README.md 의 링크/스크립트로 재다운로드.
icml_2026/pictures/
icml_2026/papers/*.pdf

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
